{"type":"turn_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_bvsNfYbQEaFpCAaskntwO7VL|fc_0f150e4357ac45a9016ad71c3d914887d0ae54ff7ca8f6063e","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"obs/agentview.png","offset":null,"limit":null}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_HWgvnWmAonAH31uheESnoLQ0|fc_0f150e4357ac45a9016ad71c3d916c87d0a633d5a605c641b0","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"obs/wrist.png","offset":null,"limit":null}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_98vudzFaPLeRWOwWl9aNlcLA|fc_0f150e4357ac45a9016ad71c3d917c87d0b47a4f49d04eb0a1","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"mkdir -p runs/current && cat > runs/current/AGENT_SUMMARY.md <<'EOF'\n# 本集记录\n\n官方指令：pick up the alphabet soup and place it in the basket。\n最终第36次 /move 返回 success=true，result.success=true；共422物理步。\n\n## 尝试与反馈\n- 按要求先探测+x，随后接近前方红绿罐，逐步下降至末端z约0.056，闭合后开口约0.637，抬升验证成功。\n- 首次错误识别了物体：红绿罐实际是番茄酱。搬入篮子后下降在z约0.190遇到blocked/contact；没有重复下降，而是在篮内释放并上撤。官方success仍false，检查放大图后确认错误。\n- 改抓右后方蓝黄色alphabet soup罐。视觉对齐后在末端约(-0.140,-0.239,0.059)闭合，开口约0.689；小幅抬升后罐跟随。\n- 抬到z约0.25，高空分段绕过瓶、盒，搬至篮口左半空位，末端约(0.027,0.260,0.208)。下降反馈ok，张开后官方success=true。\n\n## Hindsight\n世界+x朝agentview的BOTTOM，+y朝LEFT，+z抬升；腕部相机横向镜像于agentview，+x移动使静止物体在腕图向下移动。蓝黄圆罐才是alphabet soup，红绿带番茄图案的是番茄酱，不可只凭“罐”认目标。两罐均可竖直两侧夹持，抓取末端z约0.056–0.060有效；空中抬升保持gripper=0，开口约0.64–0.69不代表没夹紧。末端增量常存在约6–9毫米残差，微下降实际少于命令。支撑面精确z未测得，不应当作已知0；罐底在初始支撑上时，抓上半部末端z约0.06。篮口有效投放位置约x0.027,y0.260,z0.208，本集篮内已有误放罐仍可在侧边放汤罐。不要把下降blocked一律视作失败；先用图像区分篮底、篮沿和邻物接触，不重复同一目标。\nEOF","timeout":10}}],"api":"openai-responses","provider":"openai","model":"gpt-6.1-sol","usage":{"input":1728,"output":660,"cacheRead":64768,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":67156,"cost":{"input":0.003456,"output":0.006600000000000001,"cacheRead":0.0064768000000000004,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0165328}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1792482336008,"responseId":"resp_0f150e4357ac45a9016ad71c267fd887d099279e6e6cde7f49","rawStopReason":"completed","durationMs":31403,"thinkingLevel":"high"},"toolResults":[{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_bvsNfYbQEaFpCAaskntwO7VL|fc_0f150e4357ac45a9016ad71c3d914887d0ae54ff7ca8f6063e","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read image file [image/png]"},{"type":"image","data":"","mimeType":"image/png"}],"isError":false,"durationMs":48,"timestamp":1792482367502},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_HWgvnWmAonAH31uheESnoLQ0|fc_0f150e4357ac45a9016ad71c3d916c87d0a633d5a605c641b0","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read image file [image/png]"},{"type":"image","data":"","mimeType":"image/png"}],"isError":false,"durationMs":47,"timestamp":1792482367503},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_98vudzFaPLeRWOwWl9aNlcLA|fc_0f150e4357ac45a9016ad71c3d917c87d0b47a4f49d04eb0a1","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"(no output)"}],"isError":false,"durationMs":8,"timestamp":1792482367503}]}
